Pardon the interruption, but there are some people this may be relevant to
that also develop for Linux.  Here is info on the new mailing list.

---------- Forwarded message ----------
There is a new mailing list for discussing ACPI support in FreeBSD.  It is
freebsd-acpi@ (or just acpi@).  Topics for discussion include new drivers
or feature support in acpi, bug reports, and general power management
discussions.  Subscription info is below...

http://lists.freebsd.org/mailman/listinfo/freebsd-acpi

acpi-jp@ will continue to exist for Japanese-language discussions about
ACPI and the FreeBSD ACPI developers will continue to monitor it.  We
expect that most discussions will happen on the new list as it is better
integrated with related lists (i.e. current@).

Thanks,
Nate


